Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 04:23:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ALHIJRAH assessment engine: versioned packages, staff
 sandbox, visibility gate, extraction, What-If, draw radar, audit chain;
 provider names removed from user-facing text

- 0032 (additive): assessment_packages (immutable), assessment_staff_edits, assessment_publications (immutable, single withdrawal),
  extracted_facts, case_scenarios, audit_chain (hash-chained, append-only, head-enforced), ai_usage, ai_provider_health,
  staff_alerts, rule_watch_runs; office_vacancies.evidence_kind, office_employers.address
- lib/engine/core.ts: deterministic ranking (no padding), coverage indicator with stated method, explanation traces,
  roadmap, draw stats, scenario delta, client-safe snapshot, diff, hash chain, rounds parser
- lib/engine/store.ts: package refresh (hash dedupe, stale guard), staff edits (CAS), publish/withdraw, client view, What-If
- lib/engine/extraction.ts: AI CV/document/text parser behind client authorization and quarantine; fills empty fields only;
  conflicts and rejections preserved; staff decisions
- lib/engine/radar.ts: official Express Entry rounds watch with validation, snapshot, affected-case refresh and staff alerts
- AI usage logging and circuit breaker; provider chain status; engine health API (manager)
- staff socket signals only (client sockets drop staff frames); EnginePanel, client PublishedAssessment, EngineHealth
- user-facing text: no processing-provider names; authorization text v5 from the approved policy (LEGAL_VERSION intake-2026-11-v5)
- tests: engine-core (9), v22/engine (10), operations E2E engine journey; fixtures updated for v5 and 0032

